units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
read_data mw.data
pair_style sw
pair_coeff * * mW.sw mW
neighbor 1.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.01
fix relax all npt temp 180.0 180.0 0.200 iso 0.0 0.0 1.0
thermo 3000
run 3000
unfix relax
variable zcut equal (1.0-0.22)*lz
region top block INF INF INF INF ${zcut} INF
group top region top
group bot subtract all top
velocity top create 420.0 20261113
fix hold bot setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0
fix melt top nvt temp 420.0 420.0 0.200
run 2500
unfix hold
unfix melt
velocity all scale 250.0
fix holdnvt all nvt temp 250.0 250.0 0.200
run 1000
reset_timestep 0
dump trj all custom 100 coexist.dump id x y z
dump_modify trj sort id
run 8000
